  "headline": "Hunter Pickup Is Carrying MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f",
  "subhead": "Swap De'Andre Hunter back out for Jerami Grant and MONSTARS flip from a 6-4 lead to a 4-5 deficit.",
  "zingers": [
