   {
    "team": "BrookynDynasty",
    "line": "BrookynDynasty is up 10-1 on Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw and has 32 starts left to pile on."
   },
   {
    "team": "Adam Silver Dez Nuts",
    "line": "Shai Gilgeous-Alexander posted 38 points on the Adam Silver Dez Nuts bench, which is exactly the kind of crime this paper exists to document."
   },
   {
    "team": "White Mambas",
    "line": "White Mambas trail 8-1 and Ryan Rollins just went 3-8 for 6 points, so the 33 starts left are mostly a cry for help."
   },
   {
    "team": "LeParth James",
    "line": "Stephon Castle's 28 points and 11 assists carry LeParth James while Svi Mykhailiuk and Anfernee Simons shoot a combined 2-10 for the manager's recent pickups."
   },
   {
    "team": "Thug Life",
    "line": "Jaden McDaniels and Donovan Clingan are among the week's top players, and Thug Life still trails MONSTARS 7-4 anyway."
   },
   {
    "team": "Zero Fox Given",
    "line": "Myles Turner's 27 points and 5 threes cannot save Zero Fox Given from 7-4 against Suggs to be you, who has Kevin Durant at 32."
